        "28": {
          "content": "### Davis CoPilot Feature Adoption Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard is designed to provide administrators with a detailed overview of how Dynatrace generative AI features are being used across your environment. By providing key adoption metrics, user interaction details, feedback insights, and success indicators, you have the data you need to:\n* monitor usage and feature adoption,\n* gain insights into what users need assistance with,\n* understand when and where users are running into guardrails, and\n* monitor for misuse or abuse of generative AI.",
          "type": "markdown"
        },
