        "87": {
          "content": "### Feature adoption\n\nThis sections provides a breakdown of usage by skill, apps, and embedded prompts. Dynatrace currently offers the following generative AI skills:\n\n`chat` Refers to all interactions with the **chat interface** (includes user prompts, and app prompts) and the Workflow action (currently in private Preview).\n\n`nl2dql` Refers to all **Quick Analysis** interactions which translates natural language commands into Dynatrace Query Language in **Notebooks** and **Dashboards**.\n\n`dql2nl` Refers to all **Query Summary** interactions which provide a high-level summary as well as detailed breakdown of any DQL queries in **Notebooks** and **Dashboards**.\n\n\nFor more information on how Dynatrace maps skills to product features, please see our [documentation](https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/shortlink/copilot)",
          "type": "markdown"
        },
        "88": {
          "content": "### Prompt details\n\nThis section provides a detailed breakdown of the most recent interactions with the chat and NL2DQL skills.",
          "type": "markdown"
        },
